														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2023488">
									

<p>Uhm, okay, so. Because apparently this needs to be discussed, please move the discussion <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-856156/what-do-you-consider-the-role-of-tales-on-the-site">here</a>. Enough with this pedantry and opinion that spills off away from the tale in question.</p>

