														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2024501">
									

<p>After reading the tale (Glad I saw this, never seen 315 before) and 315's tale I completely second Lumancer on this XK-scenario situation, I'll be waiting for the next installments. On the other hand bravo, it's not the best work, but it's a great start of chaos, of uncertainty, and this is one of the few tales which questions the values of an 05 and how personnel on that level operate, more specifically in a containment breach (WHAT ELSE). Looking for some great character development and really interested in what you're doing with 315&#8230;in Seattle (Confu$ed)&#8230;Magic is the only possibility. That and 4;20.</p>

							</div>

								
					
